Third-party files

The MIT license above covers the original files of this repository.

- ramlinux/uboot/sun50i-h618-s3-v2-recovery.dts keeps its own SPDX header
  (SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)). That header applies to this
  file, not the MIT license above.
- Patch files (ramlinux/uboot/*.patch and tools/sunxi-fel-64KiB-reads.patch)
  follow the license of the upstream project that they patch (U-Boot and
  sunxi-tools).
- The build in ramlinux/ downloads U-Boot, Trusted Firmware-A, the Linux
  kernel (Armbian packages) and BusyBox. Each keeps its own license. They are
  not part of this repository.
- The Lemon TV Mini H618 firmware is not part of this repository. It belongs
  to its authors. Download it from its official source.
